====Pokémon Nest====
[[File:Pokémon Nest_Snorunt_Seafoam_Islands.png|right|thumb|Snorunt nest]]
On the ice at the top of B1F is a [[Pokémon Nests|Pokémon Nest]] containing a Snorunt egg. Taking the egg will lose the player 2 [[Karma]] and have a 10% chance of encountering a Level 40 Glalie.
