==Points of Interest==
===Blaine Rematch===
After defeating the [[Elite Four]], Blaine can be found in B1F during the [[Time|day]]. After talking to him, he will appear at the Fighting Arena in [[Vermillion City]] for a [[Gym Leader rematches|rematch]].

